# text = ' That while this Association is deeply sensible of the advantages which must accrue to the cause of science , from the production to which they have just adverted -- no less than from the unwearied researches of Samuel Pickwick , Esq ., G.C.M.P.C ., in Hornsey , Highgate , Brixton , and Camberwell -- they cannot but entertain a lively sense of the inestimable benefits which must inevitably result from carrying the speculations of that learned man into a wider field , from extending his travels , and , consequently , enlarging his sphere of observation , to the advancement of knowledge , and the diffusion of learning .
