# text = ' That the Corresponding Society of the Pickwick Club is therefore hereby constituted ; and that Samuel Pickwick , Esq ., G.C.M.P.C ., Tracy Tupman , Esq ., M.P.C ., Augustus Snodgrass , Esq ., M.P.C ., and Nathaniel Winkle , Esq ., M.P.C ., are hereby nominated and appointed members of the same ; and that they be requested to forward , from time to time , authenticated accounts of their journeys and investigations , of their observations of character and manners , and of the whole of their adventures , together with all tales and papers to which local scenery or associations may give rise , to the Pickwick Club , stationed in London .
