# text = And her father Remorse and misery Sudden disappearance -- talk of the whole city -- search made everywhere without success -- public fountain in the great square suddenly ceased playing -- weeks elapsed -- still a stoppage -- workmen employed to clean it -- water drawn off -- father-in-law discovered sticking head first in the main pipe , with a full confession in his right boot -- took him out , and the fountain played away again , as well as ever Will you allow me to note that little romance down , Sir Certainly , Sir , certainly -- fifty more if you like to hear 'em -- strange life mine -- rather curious history -- not extraordinary , but singular Magnificent ruin What a sight for an antiquarian
