# text = If you will take the trouble to turn into the field which borders the trench , take the foot-path to the left when you arrive at an angle of the fortification , and keep straight on , till you see me , I will precede you to a secluded place , where the affair can be conducted without fear of interruption Fear of interruption Nothing more to arrange , I think I am not aware of anything more Good-morning Good-morning Snodgrass Snodgrass , my dear fellow , can I rely upon your secrecy You can Hear me swear No , no don't swear , don't swear ; it's quite unnecessary I want your assistance , my dear fellow , in an affair of honour You shall have it With a doctor -- Doctor Slammer , of the 97th an affair with an officer , seconded by another officer , at sunset this evening , in a lonely field beyond Fort Pitt I will attend you The consequences may be dreadful I hope not The doctor , I believe , is a very good shot Most of these military men are but so are you , ain't you Snodgrass if I fall , you will find in a packet which I shall place in your hands a note for my -- for my father
# sent_id = 82
