# text = I cannot lay claim to the honour of forming an item in the population of Muggleton ; nor , Sir , I will frankly admit , do I covet that honour : and I will tell you why , Sir ( hear ); to Muggleton I will readily concede all these honours and distinctions to which it can fairly lay claim -- they are too numerous and too well known to require aid or recapitulation from me .
