# text = Every gentleman who hears me , is probably acquainted with the reply made by an individual , who -- to use an ordinary figure of speech --" hung out " in a tub , to the emperor Alexander :-- " if I were not Diogenes ," said he , " I would be Alexander ." I can well imagine these gentlemen to say , " If I were not Dumkins I would be Luffey ; if I were not Podder I would be Struggles ." ( Enthusiasm .)
