# text = You will wear the green velvet jacket No , no To oblige me , you will Well , well , I will would present a scene of varied and delicious enchantment -- a bewildering coruscation of beauty and talent -- a lavish and prodigal display of hospitality -- above all , a degree of splendour softened by the most exquisite taste ; and adornment refined with perfect harmony and the chastest good keeping -- compared with which , the fabled gorgeousness of Eastern fairyland itself would appear to be clothed in as many dark and murky colours , as must be the mind of the splenetic and unmanly being who could presume to taint with the venom of his envy , the preparations made by the virtuous and highly distinguished lady at whose shrine this humble tribute of admiration was offered Bravo Bravo Hoo-roar Pott Mr . Pickwick , ma'am What !
