# text = I know no gentleman in this strange place ; and ten to one if I did , whether he would believe my story Come this way My mas'r's the man you want , I see I am very sorry to betray my master , sir The feeling does you a great deal of honour but it is your duty , nevertheless I know it is my duty , Sir We should all try to discharge our duty , Sir , and I humbly endeavour to discharge mine , Sir ; but it is a hard trial to betray a master , Sir , whose clothes you wear , and whose bread you eat , even though he is a scoundrel , Sir You are a very good fellow an honest fellow Come , come Sam I am sorry to find that you have so little respect for this young man's feelings
