# text = She drew her arm coaxingly through the old man's , and whispered something in his ear ; and do what he would , old Lobbs couldn't help breaking out into a smile , while a tear stole down his cheek at the same time . ' Five minutes after this , the girls were brought down from the bedroom with a great deal of giggling and modesty ; and while the young people were making themselves perfectly happy , old Lobbs got down the pipe , and smoked it ; and it was a remarkable circumstance about that particular pipe of tobacco , that it was the most soothing and delightful one he ever smoked .
