# text = I'll go to London to-morrow Not to-morrow you're too lame Well , then , next day Next day is the first of September , and you're pledged to ride out with us , as far as Sir Geoffrey Manning's grounds at all events , and to meet us at lunch , if you don't take the field Well , then , the day after Thursday .-- Sam Sir Take two places outside to London , on Thursday morning , for yourself and me Wery well , Sir Rum feller , the hemperor uns howsoever , as is such steady goers to look at .
