# text = I understand it's capital practice I know a gen'l'man , Sir as did that , and begun at two yards ; but he never tried it on agin ; for he blowed the bird right clean away at the first fire , and nobody ever seed a feather on him arterwards Sam Sir Have the goodness to reserve your anecdotes till they are called for Well , that certainly is most capital cold punch and the day is extremely warm , and -- Tupman , my dear friend , a glass of punch With the greatest delight grounds Hunt Yes , Sir Roll this place to-morrow morning -- do you hear , Hunt Yes , Sir And take care that you keep this place in good order -- do you hear , Hunt Yes , Sir And remind me to have a board done about trespassers , and spring guns , and all that sort of thing , to keep the common people out .
