# text = I takes it reg'lar , and I can warrant it to drive away any illness as is caused by too much jollity Well , what do you think of what your father says , Sam Think , Sir why , I think he's the wictim o ' connubiality , as Blue Beard's domestic chaplain said , vith a tear of pity , ven he buried him This is pleasant , Sam I shouldn't lose an hour in seeing him ; I shall not be able to get one wink of sleep to-night , I know , unless I have the satisfaction of reflecting that I have confided this matter to a professional man Here's an old ' ooman comin ' upstairs , sir p'raps she knows where we can find somebody .
