# text = He'll be done directly , Sir A gentleman to speak to you , Sir I beg your pardon , Sir and I am very sorry to disturb the other gentlemen , too , but I come on very particular business ; and if you will suffer me to detain you at this end of the room for five minutes , I shall be very much obliged to you Ah Dodson and Fogg -- sharp practice theirs -- capital men of business , Dodson and Fogg , sir Perker ain't in town , and he won't be , neither , before the end of next week ; but if you want the action defended , and will leave the copy with me , I can do all that's needful till he comes back
