# text = Would you like to join us You don't find this sort of thing disagreeable , I hope , sir Not in the least I like it very much , although I am no smoker myself I should be very sorry to say I wasn't It's board and lodgings to me , is smoke Mr . Grundy's going to oblige the company with a song No , he ain't Why not Because he can't You had better say he won't Well , then , he won't Won't anybody enliven us Why don't you enliven us yourself , Mr . Chairman Hear ! hear Because I only know one song , and I have sung it already , and it's a fine of " glasses round " to sing the same song twice in a night I have been to-night , gentlemen I have been to-night , in a place which you all know very well , doubtless , but which I have not been in for some years , and know very little of ; I mean Gray's Inn , gentlemen .
