# text = He was obliged to take some mouldering fixtures that were on the place , and , among the rest , was a great lumbering wooden press for papers , with large glass doors , and a green curtain inside ; a pretty useless thing for him , for he had no papers to put in it ; and as to his clothes , he carried them about with him , and that wasn't very hard work , either .
