# text = Well , he had moved in all his furniture -- it wasn't quite a truck - full -- and had sprinkled it about the room , so as to make the four chairs look as much like a dozen as possible , and was sitting down before the fire at night , drinking the first glass of two gallons of whisky he had ordered on credit , wondering whether it would ever be paid for , and if so , in how many years' time , when his eyes encountered the glass doors of the wooden press . "
