# text = Well ," said the tenant , " I don't apply the observation personally to you , because it is equally applicable to most of the ghosts I ever heard of ; but it does appear to me somewhat inconsistent , that when you have an opportunity of visiting the fairest spots of earth -- for I suppose space is nothing to you -- you should always return exactly to the very places where you have been most miserable ." " Egad , that's very true ; I never thought of that before ," said the ghost . "
