# text = Make out his committal , Mr . Jinks Now , Mr . Jinks swear Grummer I beg your pardon , sir , for interrupting you but before you proceed to express , and act upon , any opinion you may have formed on the statements which have been made here , I must claim my right to be heard so far as I am personally concerned Hold your tongue , Sir I must submit to you , Sir Hold your tongue , sir or I shall order an officer to remove you You may order your officers to do whatever you please , Sir and I have no doubt , from the specimen I have had of the subordination preserved amongst them , that whatever you order , they will execute , Sir ; but I shall take the liberty , Sir , of claiming my right to be heard , until I am removed by force Pickvick and principle Sam , be quiet Dumb as a drum vith a hole in it , Sir What do you want to say First first , I wish to know what I and my friend have been brought here for Must I tell him I think you had better , sir An information has been sworn before me that it is apprehended you are going to fight a duel , and that the other man , Tupman , is your aider and abettor in it .
