# text = ' As the goblin laughed , the sexton observed , for one instant , a brilliant illumination within the windows of the church , as if the whole building were lighted up ; it disappeared , the organ pealed forth a lively air , and whole troops of goblins , the very counterpart of the first one , poured into the churchyard , and began playing at leap-frog with the tombstones , never stopping for an instant to take breath , but " overing " the highest among them , one after the other , with the most marvellous dexterity .
