# text = The first goblin was a most astonishing leaper , and none of the others could come near him ; even in the extremity of his terror the sexton could not help observing , that while his friends were content to leap over the common-sized gravestones , the first one took the family vaults , iron railings and all , with as much ease as if they had been so many street-posts .
