# text = He appeared disposed to add more , but indignation choked his utterance , so he lifted up one of his very pliable legs , and , flourishing it above his head a little , to insure his aim , administered a good sound kick to Gabriel Grub ; immediately after which , all the goblins in waiting crowded round the wretched sexton , and kicked him without mercy , according to the established and invariable custom of courtiers upon earth , who kick whom royalty kicks , and hug whom royalty hugs .
