# text = Look here ; not an opinion given yet , on any one of these cases ; and an expedition fee paid with all of 'em Something like practice that Yes and the best of it is , that as nobody alive except myself can read the serjeant's writing , they are obliged to wait for the opinions , when he has given them , till I have copied 'em , ha-ha-ha Which makes good for we know who , besides the serjeant , and draws a little more out of the clients , eh ha , ha , ha You haven't made me out that little list of the fees that I'm in your debt , have you No , I have not I wish you would Let me have them , and I'll send you a cheque .
