# text = What do you mean by that , sir What I say , Sir I should like to see you do it , Sir You shall FEEL me do it in half a minute , Sir I request that you'll favour me with your card , Sir I'll do nothing of the kind , Sir Why not , Sir Because you'll stick it up over your chimney-piece , and delude your visitors into the false belief that a gentleman has been to see you , Sir Sir , a friend of mine shall wait on you in the morning Sir , I'm very much obliged to you for the caution , and I'll leave particular directions with the servant to lock up the spoons Now just to set us going again , Bob , I don't mind singing a song The King , God bless him Bay of Biscay A Frog he would Hush !
