# text = Used , at every place she went to , to have eighteen-pence a day , a pint of porter , and a glass of spirits ; but since she became a member of the Brick Lane Branch , has always demanded three-and-sixpence ( the announcement of this most interesting fact was received with deafening enthusiasm ). ' Henry Beller was for many years toast-master at various corporation dinners , during which time he drank a great deal of foreign wine ; may sometimes have carried a bottle or two home with him ; is not quite certain of that , but is sure if he did , that he drank the contents .
