# text = Let me tell him , gentlemen , that any gestures of dissent or disapprobation in which he may indulge in this court will not go down with you ; that you will know how to value and how to appreciate them ; and let me tell him further , as my Lord will tell you , gentlemen , that a counsel , in the discharge of his duty to his client , is neither to be intimidated nor bullied , nor put down ; and that any attempt to do either the one or the other , or the first , or the last , will recoil on the head of the attempter , be he plaintiff or be he defendant , be his name Pickwick , or Noakes , or Stoakes , or Stiles , or Brown , or Thompson I shall show you , gentlemen , that for two years , Pickwick continued to reside constantly , and without interruption or intermission , at Mrs .
