# text = Oh , wery good then I'll amend the obserwation and call 'em the dear creeturs , if Blazes vill allow me Blazes I feel a great delicacy , gentlemen , in coming for'ard having the misforchune to be a coachman , and being only admitted as a honorary member of these agreeable swarrys , but I do feel myself bound , gentlemen -- drove into a corner , if I may use the expression -- to make known an afflicting circumstance which has come to my knowledge ; which has happened I may say within the soap of my everyday contemplation .
