# text = Yes , I HAVE seen 'em , sir , and they're a-comin ' to-morrow , and wos wery much surprised to hear they warn't to come to-day You have brought the things I wanted Very well , Sam listen to what I am going to say , Sam fire away , Sir I have felt from the first , Sam that this is not the place to bring a young man to un neither , Sir You're quite right , Sam but old men may come here through their own heedlessness and unsuspicion , and young men may be brought here by the selfishness of those they serve .
