# text = Now I ask you , my dear sir , not only as your legal adviser , but as your very true friend , will you let slip the occasion of attaining all these objects , and doing all this good , for the paltry consideration of a few pounds finding their way into the pockets of a couple of rascals , to whom it makes no manner of difference , except that the more they gain , the more they'll seek , and so the sooner be led into some piece of knavery that must end in a crash ?
