# text = Do you recollect , with all the eagerness of a child's love , one day pressing upon her acceptance , two small caraway-seed biscuits and one sweet apple , neatly folded into a circular parcel with the leaf of a copy-book I do She slighted that , I think She did She said I had kept the parcel so long in the pockets of my corduroys , that the apple was unpleasantly warm I remember Upon which we ate it ourselves , in alternate bites Martin Well Mr . Sawyer's I was going there Martin Well Ask the lad to step out , and mind the horse I'm going to mind the horse myself I can't permit it , on any account your testimony will be very important , and I must take you into the house with me .
