# text = However , there he lay , and I have heard my uncle say , many a time , that the man said who picked him up that he was smiling as merrily as if he had tumbled out for a treat , and that after they had bled him , the first faint glimmerings of returning animation , were his jumping up in bed , bursting out into a loud laugh , kissing the young woman who held the basin , and demanding a mutton chop and a pickled walnut .
