# text = I say , gentlemen , my uncle stopped here , for a minute , to look about him ; and then , paying a compliment to the weather , which had a little cleared up , though the moon was sinking , walked on again , as royally as before ; keeping the middle of the road with great dignity , and looking as if he would very much like to meet with somebody who would dispute possession of it with him .
