# text = This here Without goin ' so far as to as-sert , as some wery sensible people do , that postboys and donkeys is both immortal , wot I say is this : that wenever they feels theirselves gettin ' stiff and past their work , they just rides off together , wun postboy to a pair in the usual way ; wot becomes on 'em nobody knows , but it's wery probable as they starts avay to take their pleasure in some other vorld , for there ain't a man alive as ever see either a donkey or a postboy a-takin ' his pleasure in this I say this won't do , you know Bless me I'm afraid you're wet Oh , you are , are you Yes , I am , a little that way , Uncomfortably damp , perhaps I AM rather wet I think it's quite impossible to go on to-night Out of the question , sir it's a cruelty to animals , sir , to ask 'em to do it .
