# text = Yes , my dear ," said I , " but such marriages do not always turn out the happiest I question that , mind Very good question anything you like when it's your turn to speak , but don't interrupt me I beg your pardon Granted I am sorry to hear you express your opinion against marriages of affection , pa ," said Bella , colouring a little . " I was wrong ; I ought not to have said so , my dear , either ," said I , patting her cheek as kindly as a rough old fellow like me could pat it , " for your mother's was one , and so was yours ." "
