# text = At last I got tired of rendering myself unpleasant and making everybody miserable ; so I hired a carriage at Muggleton , and , putting my own horses in it , came up to town , under pretence of bringing Emily to see Arabella Miss Wardle is with you , then To be sure she is She is at Osborne's Hotel in the Adelphi at this moment , unless your enterprising friend has run away with her since I came out this morning You are reconciled then Not a bit of it she has been crying and moping ever since , except last night , between tea and supper , when she made a great parade of writing a letter that I pretended to take no notice of You want my advice in this matter , I suppose I suppose so Certainly Well then my advice is , that you both walk away together , or ride away , or get away by some means or other , for I'm tired of you , and just talk this matter over between you .
